<Document xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="System definition.xsd">
	<MD5Checksum />
	<Version Major="2020" Minor="0" Fix="0" Build="0" />
	<Content>Definition</Content>
	<Root Name="Epec Base Project" TypeGUID="03D3BA22-1485-13A6-56BD17DA950CCD00" Identifier="59f1934c-9cb1-44eb-92a2-9d4013cc30c7">
		<Description>Epec Base Project SDF provides user the default I/O which is supported by ATE.
- Aliases are imported and mapped so that user has easy access to I/O
- Basic SLSC configuration is done (48 Pull-up/Push-down outputs and 80 inputs)
- Basic PWM I/O is supported by FPGA CD (48 outputs and 80 inputs)
- PickeringSwitching CD provides access to SPDT-relays
- RMXVisaControl provides access to RMX-4125 Power supply
- Procedures &amp; Alarms TBD
</Description>
		<Properties>
			<Property Name="Name">
				<String>Epec Base Project</String>
			</Property>
			<Property Name="Version">
				<String>2.3.0.1</String>
			</Property>
			<Property Name="Creator">
				<String />
			</Property>
			<Property Name="Creation Date">
				<Double>3600957293.3245616</Double>
			</Property>
			<Property Name="ChannelDiagrams">
				<BinaryString></BinaryString>
			</Property>
			<Property Name="Revision">
				<String>[17.05.42.100 5.12.2023 by Mikko Nieminen]
added  screen for manual wiring test purposes

[10.06.33.288 29.1.2024 by Mikko Nieminen]
removed XNET DB

[15.29.15.333 8.2.2024 by Mikko Nieminen]
Enabled SLSC DI-channels (IO 81-96). Enabled Pull-up for testing purposes.

[15.56.48.283 8.2.2024 by Mikko Nieminen]
Disabled SLSC Pull-up for DI-channels

[13.18.05.329 4.4.2024 by MiNi]
Changed new FPGA bitfile
- Renamed FPGA channels to include IO-ch
- Added PWM.Set.* and PWM.In.* scalars
- Updated Aliases to point to new FPGA channels

[14.32.19.814 11.9.2024 by MiNi]
Configured all SLSC-12202 channels (in both cards, Slot6 and Slot7) Default value=Input_Sink

[15.31.15.400 13.9.2024 by MiNi]
SLSC Update channel configuration when deploying

[16.24.02.024 13.9.2024 by MiNi]
Imported aliases from .xlsx generated file

[16.20.34.550 3.1.2025 by MiNi]
Added PWM_TIMEOUT aliases for PWM HighLoad I/O-channels

</String>
			</Property>
		</Properties>
